### 5. Derived Logic

#### 5.1 Lead Score
$$\text{lead\_score} = 0.30 \times \text{intent\_signals} + 0.20 \times \text{budget\_fit} + 0.20 \times \text{test\_score\_fit} + 0.15 \times \text{timeline\_proximity} + 0.15 \times \text{source\_quality}$$[cite: 2]

* $\text{intent\_signals} = \text{engagement\_count} + \text{counselling\_response\_rate} + \text{clarity\_of\_target}$[cite: 2]
* $\text{budget\_fit} = \min(1, \frac{\text{declared\_budget}}{\text{median\_country\_cost}})$[cite: 2]
* $\text{test\_score\_fit} = \text{score\_percentile\_for\_target\_country\_band}$[cite: 2]
* $\text{timeline\_proximity} = \frac{1}{\max(\text{months\_to\_intake} - 1, 1)}$[cite: 2]
* $\text{source\_quality} = \text{lookup}(\text{source\_channel})$[cite: 2]
* **Thresholds:** Hot $\ge 0.75$, Warm $0.50\text{–}0.74$, Cold $< 0.50$[cite: 2]

#### 5.2 Eligibility Rules
* `country.min_score` $\le$ `student.test_score`[cite: 2]
* `country.min_academic_pct` $\le$ `student.aggregate`[cite: 2]
* `course.prereqs` $\subseteq$ `student.subjects_taken`[cite: 2]
* `budget_range_inr` $\ge$ `country.min_funds_proof`[cite: 2]
* `english_test_validity` at intended intake[cite: 2]
* **Override path:** Senior Counsellor with `reason_code`[cite: 2]

#### 5.3 Risk Flags
* $\text{budget\_gap\_pct} = \max(0, \frac{\text{cost\_estimate} - \text{proven\_funds}}{\text{cost\_estimate}})$[cite: 2]
* `weak_score_flag` = $\text{test\_score} < \text{country\_band\_p25}$[cite: 2]
* `visa_history_flag` = `prior_refusal == true`[cite: 2]
* `deadline_at_risk` = $\text{days\_to\_deadline} < 14 \text{ AND } \text{completion\_pct} < 75$[cite: 2]
* `doc_expiry_imminent` = $\text{any}(\text{doc.expiry} - \text{today} < 90\text{d})$[cite: 2]
* `shortlist_mismatch` = $\text{uni\_count\_in\_safe\_band} == 0$[cite: 2]
* `rejection_pattern_match` = $\text{profile\_similarity}(\text{historical\_rejections}) > 0.7$[cite: 2]

