### 7. Bottlenecks & Failure Points

| Transition | Failure Cause | Signal |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **S01 -> S02** | First-contact SLA breach | `first_contact_latency > 24h`[cite: 2] |
| **S02 -> S03** | Pricing shock / shopping | `agreement_unsigned > 7d` AND `counselling_no_show >= 1`[cite: 2] |
| **S03 -> S04** | Indecision / parent override | `shortlist_revisions > 3` OR `decision_age > 14d`[cite: 2] |
| **S04 -> S05** | Doc-collection drag | `doc_completion_pct < 60` for 14d[cite: 2] |
| **S05 -> S06** | Deadline miss / unpaid app fee | `days_to_deadline < 7` AND `status != SUBMITTED`[cite: 2] |
| **S06 -> S07** | All-reject / profile mismatch | `reject_count == total_apps`[cite: 2] |
| **S07 -> S08** | Better offer elsewhere / finance gap | `deposit_unpaid_past_deadline`[cite: 2] |
| **S09** | Loan rejection / forex short | `loan_status == REJECTED` OR `funds_gap > 0`[cite: 2] |
| **S10** | Doc gap / attestation delay | `checklist_completion < 100` AND `days_to_appointment < 7`[cite: 2] |
| **S11 -> S12** | Refusal / 221g | `decision == REJECTED` OR `admin_processing > sla`[cite: 2] |
| **S13** | Last-minute pull-out | `departure_ready < 100` at T-7[cite: 2] |

