### 8. Compact Stage x Data x Action Table

| # | Stage | Required Data (min) | Key Consultant Action | Exit Gate |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **S01** | Lead Captured | name, phone, email, source, consent | First-touch within SLA | Two-way contact + counselling slot booked[cite: 2] |
| **S02** | Qualified Lead | qualification, intake, target_countries, budget, test_status | Qualification call, MQL/SQL tag | `lead_score >= threshold`[cite: 2] |
| **S03** | Counselling | full academic history, course pref, career goal | Service agreement + onboarding fee | Agreement `SIGNED` + fee `CAPTURED`[cite: 2] |
| **S04** | Shortlisting | shortlist[uni, course, intake, deadline], intake | Build comparison sheet, lock list | Shortlist signed off[cite: 2] |
| **S05** | Application Started | per-app: portal creds, draft, SOP v1, LOR requestees | Open portals, brief SOP, request LOR/transcripts | All apps `IN_PROGRESS`[cite: 2] |
| **S06** | Application Submitted | per-app: submitted_at, fee_txn, final SOP/LOR/transcripts | Submit + pay fee + log | All apps `SUBMITTED`[cite: 2] |
| **S07** | Offer Received | per-app: decision_type, offer_uri, conditions, deadline | Log + share + advise | Decisions captured for all apps[cite: 2] |
| **S08** | Offer Accepted | chosen_app_id, acceptance_letter, deposit_receipt, declines | Pay deposit, request CAS/I-20/COE/LOA | Deposit `CAPTURED` + uni ack[cite: 2] |
| **S09** | Financial Planning | cost_estimate, funding_breakdown, loan, bank stmts, ITR | Loan facilitation, dossier build | `financial_proof_complete`[cite: 2] |
| **S10** | Visa Documentation | passport, immigration doc, fees, photos, doc sets | Country checklist + appointment | Checklist 100% + appointment booked[cite: 2] |
| **S11** | Visa Filed | filing_date, ref_no, biometrics, interview, fee | File at VFS/embassy + interview prep | Case = `AWAITING_DECISION`[cite: 2] |
| **S12** | Visa Approved/Rejected | decision, decision_date, visa_uri OR rejection_code | RCA + branch (proceed / rework / close) | Branch executed[cite: 2] |
| **S13** | Pre-Departure | flight, accommodation, forex, insurance, final tuition | Pre-departure session, partner tie-ups | `departure_ready == 100` at T-1[cite: 2] |
| **S14** | Student Landed | arrival_at, on_ground_contact, uni_registration | Confirm + feedback + referral | `arrival_confirmed` -> `COMPLETED`[cite: 2] |

